cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this pilot archive, please cite this repository and the upstream
  sources listed in the README.
type: software
title: Subspace Intervention Geometry
authors:
  - family-names: Razdan
    given-names: Shuhul
repository-code: https://github.com/shuhulx/Subspace-Intervention-Geometry
abstract: >-
  Archived code and records for a ten-prompt Gemma 2 2B Instruct pilot comparing
  sequential removal of overlapping directions with removal of their joint
  span. The archive documents effective writer geometry, exploratory
  unblinded AI ratings and a failed historical replay. The behavioral
  comparison is inconclusive.
keywords:
  - mechanistic interpretability
  - subspace ablation
  - research archive
